          "8:17. 65 Col. 2:19. 66 Cf. Eph. 4:11-16. 67 Cf. Eph. 4:23. 68 Cf. Eph. 5:25-28. 69 Ibid. 23-24. 70 Col. 2:9. 71 Cf. Eph. 1:22-23. 72 Cf. Eph. 3:19. 73 Cf. Eph. 4:16. 74 Jn. 21:17. 75 Cf. Mt. 28:18, f. 76 1 Tim. 3:15. 77 Phil. 2:6. 78 2 Cor. 8:9. 79 Lk. 4:18. 80 Lk. 19:10. 81 Heb. 7:26. 82 2 Cor. 5:21. 83 Cf. Heb. 2:17. 84 Cf. 1 Cor. 11:26. 85 Cf. Acts 10:35. 86 Jer. 31:31-34. 87 Cf. 1 Cor. 11:25. 88 Cf. 1 Pt. 1:23. 89 Cf. Jn. 3:5-6. 90 1 Pt. 2:9-10. 91 Rom. 4:25. 92 Cf. Jn. 13:34. 93 Cf. Col. 3:4. 94 Rom. 8:21. 95 Cf. Mt. 5:13-16. 96 Neh. 13:1; cf. Deut. 23:1 ff; Num. 20:4. 97 Cf. Heb. 13:14. 98 Cf. Mt. 16:18. 99 Cf. Acts 20:28. 100 Cf. Heb. 5:1-5. 101 Cf Rev. 6:1; cf. 5:9-10 102 Cf. 1 Pt.2:4-10. 103 Cf. Acts 2:42-47. 104 Cf. Rom. 12:1. 105 Cf 1 Pt. 3:15 107 Cf. Rom; 8:17; Col. 1:24; 2 Tim. 2:11-12; 1 Pet. 4:13. 108 Cf. Eph. 5:32. 109 Cf. 1 Cor. 7, 7. 110 Cf. Heb. 13:15. 111 Cf. Jn. 2:20, 27 112 Cf. 1 Thess. 2:13. 113 Cf. Jud. 3 114 1 Cor. 12:11. 115 Cf. 1 Thess 5:12, 19-21. 116 Cf. Jn. 11:52. 117 Cf. Heb. 1:2. 119 Cf. Acts 2:42. 120 Cf. Jn. 18:36 121 Cf. Ps. 2:8. 122 Cf. Ps.",
